{{DISPLAYTITLE:#TopSecret}}
'''<nowiki>#</nowiki>TopSecret''' (＃極秘任務, ''#Gokuhi Ninmu'', '''#SecretMission''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Critical Rate UP (Sm): [[Critical Hit]] chance for all cats that have the ability is increased by 1%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|#TopSecret|"Critical" Rate Up (Sm)|Sacred Blade Sakura Z|jpname=＃極秘任務|link=}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This is currently the only Cat Combo to include an [[Ultra Form]].

